# This is a sample .gitignore file for C#/ .NET projects

## Build artifacts
bin/
obj/
**/bin/
**/obj/

## Visual Studio
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/

## Rider
.idea/

## Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

## Debug / Release folders
Debug/
Release/

## Publish output
publish/
*.deploy

## NuGet
*.nupkg
packages/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

## Logs
*.log

## OS generated files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

## Runtime files
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache

## JetBrains Rider
/.idea/

## User-specific files
*.userprefs

## Others
*.vspscc
*.vssscc
launchSettings.json

